        <mxCell id="b_f3" value="&lt;b&gt;Metadata &amp;amp; Raster Screening&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Validates TIFF header structure and GeoTIFF tags&lt;br/&gt;• Verifies flight boundary coordinates against plot GPS&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mission State Persistence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Creates mission record in DynamoDB &lt;i&gt;missions&lt;/i&gt; table&lt;br/&gt;• Status: &lt;i&gt;RECEIVED&lt;/i&gt; with metadata and timestamp&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;EventBridge Pipeline Integration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Emits &lt;i&gt;MissionValidated&lt;/i&gt; event to EventBridge bus&lt;br/&gt;• Quarantines corrupted files to S3 &lt;i&gt;quarantine/&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
