        <mxCell id="b_f4" value="&lt;b&gt;AI Model Inference Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Amazon Bedrock Foundation Model (Claude 3.5 Sonnet / Vision)&lt;br/&gt;• Multispectral canopy stress &amp;amp; chlorophyll analysis&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Disease &amp;amp; Anomaly Detection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Coffee leaf rust (&lt;i&gt;Hemileia vastatrix&lt;/i&gt;) lesion scoring&lt;br/&gt;• Outputs GeoJSON heatmaps with georeferenced bounding boxes&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inference Storage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Output stored in S3 &lt;i&gt;processed-analysis/&lt;/i&gt; and DynamoDB" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
