        <mxCell id="b_f5" value="&lt;b&gt;Human-in-the-Loop Verification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Results delivered to certified agronomist portal&lt;br/&gt;• Expert reviews AI rust confidence score&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Authorization &amp;amp; Treatment Order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Agronomist approves or adjusts phytosanitary prescription&lt;br/&gt;• Status updated to &lt;i&gt;AUTHORIZED&lt;/i&gt; in DynamoDB&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Federation Audit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Cryptographic signature attached for origin certification" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
